('127.170.d.9.A',4,'Adding a short description of your role on each sample in a portfolio helps employers:','["Guess your skills", "Understand exactly what you contributed", "Ignore your résumé", "Skip your work"]'::jsonb,1,'Portfolio documentation.','original'),
('127.170.d.9.B',3,'Attending a local industry meetup to talk with engineers is:','["Wasting time", "Avoiding work", "Professional networking", "Social hiding"]'::jsonb,2,'Networking.','original')
